  - zapata/koopman.py   removed unused imports (distutils, tkinter.tix) absent in Python >= 3.12/3.13
  - zapata/lib.py       pkg_resources import made optional
  - zapata/colormap.py  colormap directory resolved relative to the package
  - zapata/data.py      case-insensitive fallback for ERA5 file names on Linux
  - AIModels/UtilPlot.py LaTeX output written to DEEPSEASONS_WORKDIR instead of a hard-coded path

